{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And we watched</b> — like שוקד אני (I am watching). And the sense of \"for HaShem's sake\": for the sake of this Name that we mention. And Rabbi Moses said: \"for Your sake, HaShem,\" and in the midrash: for the sake of Abraham, who first called this Name written with alef-dalet."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:20:35.938362577Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}